ath you are, the stronger you became?...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only chance at survival is pure adrenaline, As health drops, adrenaline surges. Movement is faster, attacks hit harder. Fights become a downward spiral of power and risk. No lock on, don't think, JUST… KEEP… MOVING…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or as a party in action combat, survive in a open ended world always trying to kill you, and protect your few resources from running out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464200/extras/7ef5cbefaa6764a411239501bcd98829.poster.avif?t=1787905897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464200/extras/7ef5cbefaa6764a411239501bcd98829.webm?t=1787905897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464200/extras/7ef5cbefaa6764a411239501bcd98829.mp4?t=1787905897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Horror Infinity Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the world with your own story, in this open hardcore survival mode giving you the complete freedom to play how you want. You decide what you do, where to go and how best to survive. The world changes every time, monsters grow as time passes, experience true infinite survival horror in the full open map sandbox with a single life<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464200/extras/d68678970d4d1d0bf1c6bc5c97d5bb14.poster.avif?t=1787905897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464200/extras/d68678970d4d1d0bf1c6bc5c97d5bb14.webm?t=1787905897\" type=\"video/webm; 